OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773943433
OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G5/18
OL,2,V55555555CWELSH GROUP CLAIMS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CFIREBOMB ATTACKS
OL,5, Police are probing three new firebomb
OL,6, attacks on English estate agents'
OL,7, offices within hours of each other.
OL,9, A caller to a BBC Wales journalist
OL,10, said attacks in London, Liverpool and
OL,11, the West Midlands were the work of the
OL,12, extremist Sons of Glyndower group.
OL,14, Two of the incendiary devices exploded
OL,15, after being pushed through letter boxes
OL,16, at estate agents in Liverpool and
OL,17, Sutton Coldfield, causing minor damage.
OL,19, In Wapping Bomb Squad officers defused
OL,20, another device. In the past year there
OL,21, have been several Welsh extremist
OL,22, attacks on English estate agents.
OL,23,F]DFrom 19-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49606
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773943433
OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G6/18
OL,2,V55555555CCHANNEL CHEMICAL HUNT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CHIT BY WEATHER
OL,5, The French navy has had to call off a
OL,6, search for a container of highly toxic
OL,7, insecticide because of bad weather.
OL,9, The container was from an Indonesian
OL,10, freighter which sank off the Channel
OL,11, Island of Alderney.
OL,13, The drum contains six tons of Lindane,
OL,14, which is linked to cancer and blood
OL,15, disorders and which could kill fish and
OL,16, damage shoreline plants and wildlife.
OL,18, Greenpeace spokesman Paul Johnstone
OL,19, said the Channel could face an
OL,20, environmental disaster if the chemical
OL,21, was released.
OL,23,F]DFrom 19-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
