PN,49607
SC,0007
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773943433
OL,1,V7w3s7s35                          G7/18
OL,2,V55555555CONE DEAD, SIX HURT
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CIN SCOTTISH AVALANCHE
OL,5, One climber died and six were injured
OL,6, after they were swept away in an
OL,7, avalanche in the Grampian Mountains.
OL,9, The dead man, who came from Aberdeen,
OL,10, was in a party of two climbing at
OL,11, Lochnagar, near Balmoral. He has not
OL,12, been named.
OL,14, The other party consisted of six
OL,15, members of a Scottish walking club.
OL,16, They were taken to Aberdeen Royal
OL,17, Infirmary but were not seriously hurt.
OL,19, The alarm was raised when the only
OL,20, climber not injured in the avalanche
OL,21, managed to reach a farmhouse.
OL,23,F]DFrom 19-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
