OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773943433
OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G8/18
OL,2,V55555555CPEDESTRIAN DIES IN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CPOLICE CAR ACCIDENT
OL,5, A pedestrian has been killed in an
OL,6, accident involving a marked police car
OL,7, driven by a woman inspector.
OL,9, The man was the seventh person to die
OL,10, in road accidents involving police
OL,11, vehicles in recent weeks.
OL,13, Cleveland Police said Insp Sue Turnbull
OL,14, was answering a call to a garage
OL,15, burglary when the accident happened in
OL,16, Stockton-on-Tees.
OL,18, A police spokesman said she was unhurt
OL,19, but was shocked. The dead man was aged
OL,20, between 16 and 20.
OL,23,F]DFrom 19-03-89 / teletextarchive.com
